  "visible_text": "Platform\nSolutions\nResources\nAbout Us\nPartners\nResearch\nEN\nSupport Login\nRequest a Demo\nAgentic AI built to keep the world’s money moving safely\n\nFrom global banks to emerging fintechs, we stop fraud and financial crime in real time - with AI that catches risk and an AI agent that helps your teams act and respond faster\n\nRequest a Demo\n\nNew\nMeet Farol, the AI agent for fraud teams\n\nTake control of rules, alerts, and SARs. Less time on admin, more time stopping fraud.\n\nTrusted by global financial leaders\nProven AI securing billions of transactions, now backed by an AI agent that keeps you focused on what really matters.\nPurpose-Built AI. Proven Expertise.\n\nFor more than a decade, we've pioneered AI to stop financial crime, backed by deep behavioral expertise. Now our AI agent works alongside your analysts, taking on the grunt work so your people can focus on the calls only they can make.\n\nTrusted by Global Leaders.\n\nBeyond securing transactions, we protect the systems the global economy relies on, from the world’s largest banks to the regulators who oversee them.\n\nGlobal Intelligence. Collective Power.\n\nBy turning global data into actionable insights, every Feedzai customer benefits from the power of collective intelligence to uncover and stop the risks they can’t see alone.\n\nAlways Adapting. Always Ahead.\n\nFeedzai’s AI scales through the expertise of our world-class researchers, bridging the gap from lab to product. We turn academic research into real-life usability and protection - shielding you from today’s fraud and tomorrow’s financial crime.\n\nWe don’t just defend,\nwe dominate the threat landscape.\n\nRequest a Demo\n\nFeedzai RiskOps unifies defense across the entire financial crime lifecycle — securing your business and the world’s money with a single, proven approach.\n\nLearn More\n\nOutsmart Sophisticated Scams and Fraud\n\nWe turn fragmented signals into smart, AI-first real-time decisions, helping banks stop fraud and scams at scale with fewer false positives.\n\nLearn More\n\nProtecting Identities Beyond Data\n\nBy uniting real-time behavioural and device intelligence, we identify abnormal behaviour and signs of manipulation early - helping banks intervene before harm is done, without adding unnecessary friction.\n\nLearn More\n\nMaximize Your AML Efficiency\n\nAI-powered AML that scales with regulatory change and product expansion, enabling accurate, consistent detection of suspicious activity.\n\nLearn More\n\nWe deliver measurable protection.\n1 billion consumers\n140 billion events processed per year\n$19T in payments secured every year\n62% more fraud detected*\n\n*vs. Previous solution, as reported by tier 1 bank\n\n73% fewer false positives*\n\n*vs. Previous solution, as reported by tier 1 bank\n\n25x faster model deployment*\n\n*vs. Previous solution, as reported by tier 1 bank\n\n13x faster rule analysis\n\nCustomer Stories\n\nReal Stories, Real Impact.\n\nView All Customer Stories\n\n“Ability to handle complex fraud scenarios”\n\nView Case Study\n\nAward-Winning Security\nFuture-Ready Security\nEstablishment of low fraud rates\n“Achieve higher standards of payment security.”\n\nView Case Study\n\n90% Fraud Reduction\n35+ Issuers Seamlessly Migrated\n“We’re Not Just Reacting Anymore—We’re Anticipating”\n\nView Case Study\n\nGreater customer trust\nFaster response to threats\n“Reduces the friction with your customer base”\n\nView Case Study\n\n46% reduction in declined transactions for fraud\n64% fraud detection rate\nIndustry-leading risk management\nData Orchestration\n\nLeader in the SPARK Matrix™: Data Management for Financial Crime, Q4 2025\n\nDownload\nFraud Prevention\n\nFraud Prevention Leader in Chartis 2026 RiskTech Quadrant® for Fraud Platforms\n\nDownload\nAnti-Money Laundering\n\nTop 18 Vendors for AML Transaction Monitoring\n\nDownload\nECB Selects Feedzai to Secure the Digital Euro\nRead more\nPrevent any risk, in any channel, at any stage of the journey.\n\nRequest a Demo\n\nEN\n\nSolutions\n\nRiskOps Platform\nAI\nFeedzai Orchestration\nFeedzai IQ\nFraud\nTransaction Fraud\nScam Prevention\nMerchant Acquiring\nFeedzai IQ Score\nMerchant IQ Signals\nIdentity\nSecure Onboarding\nDigital Trust\nAML\nAML Transaction Monitoring\nWatchlist Screening\n\nInsights\n\nResource Library\nBlog\nEvents\nVideos\nPodcasts\nCustomer Stories\n\nIndustries\n\nRetail Banks\nCommercial Banks\nPayment Service Providers\nMerchant Acquirers\nCore Banking Providers\nGovernment\n\nCompany\n\nAbout Us\nLeadership\nPartners\nNewsroom\nPress Releases\nResearch\nCareers\nSupport\nContact Us\n\n© Feedzai\n\nLegal\nPrivacy Policy\nCalifornia Candidates Privacy Policy\nEU co-funded projects\nPatents\nCookies\nAo clicar em \"Aceitar todos os cookies\", concorda com o armazenamento de cookies no seu dispositivo para melhorar a navegação no site, analisar a utilização do site e ajudar nas nossas iniciativas de marketing. Reveja as nossas Cookies e Privacy Policies para mais informações.\nDefinições de cookies\nRecusar cookies não essenciais Aceitar todos os cookies",
